# asciiunits-ts completion checklist (suleman-uzair)

1. Runtime load: parsanol npm runtime over artifacts/unitsml.json (+ tables/),
   checksum verified against artifacts/unitsml.checksums.txt.
2. parse(input): expression entry, native-first with the pure-JS fallback.
3. Corpus replay: npm run replay against asciiunits-testsuite — 143/143 kinds.
4. Model adapter: captures -> a typed AsciiUnits model (Unit/Prefix/Number/
   Extender/Fenced/Sqrt), mirroring unitsml-ruby's Unitsml::Parg::TreeMapper.
5. npm publish as @unitsml/asciiunits-ts (trusted publishing via OIDC,
   mirroring @unitsml/unitsdb).
